  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7901.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the standards and procedures for local law enforcement to determine if a person is a missing adult as defined in RSA 106-J:1, including filing a missing person report and reporting information to the National Crime Information Center and designated media outlets.\n\nSource. #14199, eff 2-25-25",
